    "code": "# Python program to find the first\n# repeated character in a string\ndef firstRepeatedChar(str):\n \n    h = {} # Create empty hash\n \n    # Traverse each characters in string\n    # in lower case order\n    for ch in str:\n \n        # If character is already present\n        # in hash, return char\n        if ch in h:\n            return ch;\n \n        # Add ch to hash\n        else:\n            h[ch] = 0\n \n    return ''\n \n \n# Driver code\nprint(firstRepeatedChar(\"geeksforgeeks\"))",
